+ In mutation call, have we inncluded all return json documents:Step 2. Create a cart and display the menu
+After a desired location has been identified, a cart should be created. The cart provides an interface for building a composable booking experience.
+
+Note: The ID of the cart can be stored in the client's cookies or local storage to provide a resumable booking experience that persists betwee
+n page loads.
+
+mutation {
+  createCart(input: {
+    locationId: "1"
+  }) {
+    cart {
+      id
+
+      availableCategories {
+        name
+
+        availableItems {
+          id
+          name
+        }
+      }
+    }
+  }
+}
